BASELINE / THIRD-PARTY NOTICE

`src/nyaya_verification/legacy_engine/` is a verbatim vendored copy of the
pre-existing Nyāya Engine as delivered (zip asset, payload files stamped
2026-07-21 08:30; no upstream VCS history or license file). It is preserved
byte-identical for reproducibility and is NOT covered by the MIT grant above.
Its own documentation states the original terms (legacy_engine/README.md,
"License & Source-Text Note"):

  "All code in this repository is provided for the user's own, zero-cost,
  local use."

The ingested Tarkasaṃgraha-with-Dīpikā text bundled inside the baseline
(`legacy_engine/data/tarkasangraha_corpus.json`, the 1930 Athalye/Bodas
edition) likewise remains under its original handling: stored locally as the
engine's own source-text base, per the baseline README. Classical-source
bibliography: `research/source_audit.md`.
